:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Zangief (Enemy)]].''
'''Zangief''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 514
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Zangief
|name2 = Zangief CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Zangief CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Thanks to his massive negative range, Zangief can be a decent all-rounder unit against [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], although you might just want to draw from the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|IRON LEGION]] pool instead as his lack of a consistent defensive ability (20% chance for dodge) and long recharge time hinder his usage a lot, especially for a tank. Considering that, there's also the issue of his stats as they are not ideal enough to handle high damage Zombie enemies like [[Cadaver Bear]], [[Dread Bore]] or [[Lord Gravey]].

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Sniper}}

